      "comment" : "Dinosaurs swipe hint."
    },
    "Sync content of unread articles" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sincronizar el contenido de los artículos no leídos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing article content increases iCloud storage use, sync time, and battery use.\n\nArticle status and the content of starred articles are always synced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sincronizar el contenido de los artículos aumenta el uso del almacenamiento de iCloud, el tiempo de sincronización y el consumo de batería.\n\nEl estado de los artículos y el contenido de los artículos destacados siempre se sincronizan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default (%@)" : {
      "comment" : "Default browser item title format",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Predeterminado del sistema (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks to Sheila and my family; thanks to my friends in Seattle and around the globe; thanks to the ever-patient and ever-awesome NetNewsWire beta testers.\n\nThanks to [Gus Mueller](https://shapeof.com/) for [FMDB](https://github.com/ccgus/fmdb) by [Flying Meat Software](http://flyingmeat.com/). Thanks to [GitHub](https://github.com) and [Discourse](https://discourse.com) for making open source collaboration easy and fun. Thanks to [Ben Ubois](https://benubois.com/) at [Feedbin](https://feedbin.com) for all the extra help with syncing and article rendering — and [for hosting the server for the Reader view](https://feedbin.com/blog/2019/03/11/the-future-of-full-content/)." : {
      "comment" : "A list of credits for the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The API endpoint is invalid. Use a base URL starting with https:// — http:// is allowed only for local addresses." : {
      "comment" : "Summary endpoint error",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El endpoint de la API no es válido. Usa una URL base que empiece por https://; http:// solo está permitido para direcciones locales."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The API key could not be read. Re-enter it in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Summary credential error",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer la clave de API. Introdúcela de nuevo en Ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key could not be removed from the Keychain. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Summaries key error",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo eliminar la clave del llavero. Inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key could not be stored in the Keychain. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Summaries key error",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo guardar la clave en el llavero. Inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key could not be updated in the Keychain. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Summary credential error",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo actualizar la clave en el llavero. Inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is stored in the macOS Keychain only. Summaries are generated only when you choose Summarize while reading an article, and are never stored or synced." : {
      "comment" : "Summaries preferences help",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clave se guarda solo en el llavero de macOS. Los resúmenes se generan únicamente cuando eliges Resumir durante la lectura de un artículo, y nunca se guardan ni se sincronizan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name can be anything you want. You can even use emoji. 🎸" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El nombre puede ser el que quieras. Incluso puedes usar emojis. 🎸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The on-device model is not available." : {
      "comment" : "Summaries local model unavailable",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El modelo del dispositivo no está disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
